Subject: [PATCH 07/10] plat: imx8m: add SIP cpu_off service

Added SIP cpu_off service for imx8mm/n/p.

Signed-off-by: Jiafei Pan <Jiafei.Pan@nxp.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
